### Replace {{scheduleId}} with actual schedule ID from /schedules endpoint
### Valid coordinate format: X|Y where X and Y are integers
### Valid header: PlayerName,Village,Spear,Sword,Archer,Marcher,Catapult,Axe,Polearm,Ram,Trebuchet
### Data stored in database as gzip-compressed base64 string
